I walk out onto the street.
The sky is dark grey and heavy.
It is very cold today.
A cold wind is blowing.
I pull my coat tighter.
I walk to the U-Bahn.
Suddenly it snows a little.
The snow is wet.
Then it rains.
The rain is icy.
So the forecast is right.
It will rain a lot today.
I quickly open my umbrella.
But I am very cold.
Finally I see the U-Bahn station.
I go quickly down the stairs.
The platform is fortunately dry.
Down here it is warmer.
